-- Probe (g1b, 2026-09-30): the same with a field herald on its own line below the TYPICALLY field. Measured: the herald attaches to the TYPICALLY value ("could not find ... escalaPorNumeroDeCrimes [how the increase is chosen]"), not to the field. Fails on purpose.
@lang pt
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE `Leitura do aumento` IS ONE OF
    faixaDoJuiz
    @nlg:en the judge's range
    escalaPorNumeroDeCrimes
    @nlg:en the scale

DECLARE `Leituras` HAS
    `aumento do crime continuado` IS A `Leitura do aumento` TYPICALLY escalaPorNumeroDeCrimes
    @nlg:en how the increase is chosen

`a leitura` MEANS `Leituras` WITH `aumento do crime continuado` IS faixaDoJuiz
#ASSERT `a leitura`'s `aumento do crime continuado` EQUALS faixaDoJuiz
